lts['count']} matches found)\")\n                for match in results['matches']:\n                    print(f\"\\n[Rank {match['rank']}] Rule ID: {match['rule_id']}\")\n                    print(f\"Distance Score: {match['distance']} | Confidence: {match['confidence']}\")\n                    print(f\"Metrics       : {match['metrics']}\")\n                    print(\"Raw Code Snippet:\")\n       